{"title":"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> has the property that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/c/6ac15a6dd7bbd84e601199a22d0ef953e25dff2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3x-1)=x^2+x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"19\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.  What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e666a10991c7006492fd948a0a240a7c380e3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/c/c4c6c872f8438e7cc0ff092bdb1f52f71ad1d738.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 13 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 31 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 111 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 211$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"396\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/9/ad97acb904dc8e1dcc5d878e3a5bcd424a6cbc0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x-1 =5 \\implies x= 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e27f20f85ad02bfea2b2fe02659e9f55dc29a4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3(2)-1) = 2^2+2+1=7 \\implies (A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"301\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 